🚀 Installation
git clone <repository>
cd Hybrid-Quantum-Image-Classifier
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
Open: http://127.0.0.1:5000
📸 Usage
1. Open the application
2. Upload an image
3. Click Predict
4. View prediction and confidence score


📊 Dataset
Classes: Rain, Sky, Road


🧪 Quantum Computing Concepts
Qubits, Angle Embedding, Quantum State Encoding, Variational Quantum Circuits, Quantum Gates, Entanglement, Expectation Measurement, Hybrid Quantum Neural Networks


📈 Future Improvements
Multi-class classification, IBM Quantum integration, Live camera prediction, Explainable AI (Grad-CAM), Larger dataset, Cloud deployment


📚 Research Motivation
The project demonstrates a Hybrid Quantum Neural Network that combines transfer learning with quantum computing to explore emerging Quantum AI techniques.


